      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Saint Laurent has just dropped its Fall/Winter 2026 menswear bag collection, continuing the house's signature minimalist tailoring and functional silhouettes. The new lineup includes the Bowling tote, Niki messenger bag, and foldable shopping tote, rendered in timeless shades of black, olive, and caramel. Clean lines sharpen a modern, commanding presence.",
