    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Niki small messenger bag arrives in grained lambskin, calfskin, and grained nubuck, dressed in classic, understated black or caramel. It features a tonal matte or silver YSL Cassandre logo, magnetic snap closure for easy access, two main compartments, and a back flat pocket. The adjustable strap allows for hand-carry or shoulder wear, and its compact build makes it a lightweight daily essential.",
